    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.completion\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.12.x\n\n### Description\n\nhttps://github.com/matkrin/bashd\nhttps://github.com/bash-lsp/bash-language-server\n\nbashd is a new lightweight alternative to bash-language-server.\n\nmini.completion is not working with bashd.\n\n\n### Reproduction\n\n### bashd mini.completion\n\n```lua\nvim.lsp.config.bashd = {\n    cmd = { \"bashd\" },\n    filetypes = { \"sh\" },\n}\n\nvim.lsp.enable(\"bashd\")\n\nvim.pack.add({\n    \"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim\"\n})\n\nrequire(\"mini.completion\").setup({})\n```\n\n1. nvim test.sh\n2. insert mode\n3. ctrl space\n\n```lua\nE5108: Lua: ...vim/site/pack/core/opt/mini.nvim/lua/mini/completion.lua:1266: attempt to index local 'word' (a userdata value)\nstack traceback:\n        ...vim/site/pack/core/opt/mini.nvim/lua/mini/completion.lua:1266: in function 'lsp_completion_response_items_to_complete_items'\n        ...vim/site/pack/core/opt/mini.nvim/lua/mini/completion.lua:486: in function <...vim/site/pack/core/opt/mini.nvim/lua/mini/completion.lua:436>\n```\n\n### bashd vim.lsp.completion\n\n```lua\nvim.lsp.config.bashd = {\n    cmd = { \"bashd\" },\n    filetypes = { \"sh\" },\n}\n\nvim.lsp.enable(\"bashd\")\n\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"LspAttach\", {\n    group = vim.api.nvim_create_augroup(\"lsp\", { clear = true }),\n\n    callback = function(ev)\n        local client = assert(vim.lsp.get_client_by_id(ev.data.client_id))\n\n        if client:supports_method(\"textDocument/completion\") then\n            vim.lsp.completion.enable(true, client.id, ev.buf, { autotrigger = true })\n            vim.opt_local.completeopt = { \"menuone\", \"noselect\", \"popup\" }\n            vim.keymap.set(\"i\", \"<c-space>\", vim.lsp.completion.get, { buffer = ev.buf })\n        end\n    end,\n})\n```\n\ncompletion works\n\n### bashls mini.completion\n\n```lua\nvim.pack.add({\n    \"https://github.com/neovim/nvim-lspconfig\",\n})\n\nvim.lsp.enable(\"bashls\")\n\nvim.pack.add({\n    \"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim\"\n})\n\nrequire(\"mini.completion\").setup({})\n```\n\ncompletion works\n",
